      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "2",
      "description": "<p>The invidiak Strides up to twice their speed. If the invidiak ends their movement in an area of dim light, they become hidden as long as they don't move and the lighting in the area they're in doesn't grow brighter than dim light.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Shadow Blend",
